# Root build context exclusions — post-M2 audit fix H4.
#
# edge-gateway's image is built from the REPO ROOT (not from
# services/edge-gateway) so that the Cargo WORKSPACE lockfile, which lives
# here, is actually in the build context. Without this file that context
# would be ~11G, almost all of it Rust build output and node_modules, and
# the build would be unusable.
#
# Everything below is either regenerated by the build itself or has no
# business inside an image.

# Rust build output (the bulk of it).
/target
**/target

# Node.
**/node_modules
admin-panel/.next

# Python.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# VCS and tooling state.
.git
.github
.nx
.claude

# Local-only and sensitive.
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.tsbuildinfo

# Docs and audit artifacts — never needed to build a binary.
docs
runbooks
Audit.txt
